cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MGRB in research, publications, reports, or figures, cite the exact release used and retain upstream data attribution."
title: "Maritime Geospatial Research Base (MGRB)"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Tsuchiya
    given-names: Takahiro
version: 1.0.0
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A local, reproducible product that automates public maritime geospatial source integration,
  cartographic defaults, evidence-safe track processing, and portable QGIS research packages.
keywords:
  - maritime research
  - QGIS
  - bathymetry
  - reproducible research
  - geospatial research
